    "body": "### Description\n\nIn commits after 9ccfa74, Powershell Editor Services LSP is broken.\n\nNVIM v0.12.5\nLazyVim\nLSPs are installed using Mason\n\nlsp.log:\n\n```\n[ERROR][2026-09-07 19:37:57] ...lar/neovim/0.12.5/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/log.lua:150\t\"rpc\"\t\"pwsh\"\t\"stderr\"\t\"\\27[31;1m&: \\27[31;1mThe term '/Users/jihillestad/.local/share/nvim/mason/packages/powershell-editor-services/Start-EditorServices.ps1' is not recognized as a name of a cmdlet, function, script file, or executable program.\\27[0m\\n\\27[31;1m\\27[31;1mCheck the spelling of the name, or if a path was included, verify that the path is correct and try again.\\27[0m\\n\"\n```\n\nRolling back to **3928e63** is a temporary workaround.",
